# Retired paths.
#
# assets/catalog held a marketing PDF whose XMP metadata carried the Chinese
# entity name, and media/social held ~420MB of social clips nothing on the site
# linked to. Both were removed from the web root on 2026-07-20.
#
# Deleting the files was not enough on its own: Cloudflare's edge kept answering
# the old URLs 200 from cache (cf-cache-status: REVALIDATED) even though the
# origin returned 404. Serving a redirect changes the response the edge stores,
# which retires the cached copy, and permanently claims the paths so a stray file
# dropped there later cannot go quietly public again.
/assets/catalog/*  /  301
/media/social/*    /  301
/media/*           /  301
